      <trans-unit id="tx_simplecmptypo3_service.cookies.description"><source>Strings (exact match) or /regex/ (slash-bounded), e.g. ["_ga", "/^_ga_/", "_gid"].</source><target>Strings (exakt) oder /regex/ (Slash-begrenzt), z. B. ["_ga", "/^_ga_/", "_gid"].</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_simplecmptypo3_service.origins"><source>Origin matchers (JSON array)</source><target>Origin-Muster (JSON-Array)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_simplecmptypo3_service.origins.description"><source>Host strings or wildcards, e.g. ["www.google-analytics.com", "*.doubleclick.net"].</source><target>Host-Strings oder Wildcards, z. B. ["www.google-analytics.com", "*.doubleclick.net"].</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_simplecmptypo3_service.extensions"><source>Extensions (JSON)</source><target>Erweiterungen (JSON)</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_simplecmptypo3_service.fe_visible"><source>Show on consent banner</source><target>Im Einwilligungs-Banner anzeigen</target></trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="tx_simplecmptypo3_service.fe_visible.description"><source>Off by default for library imports — they pre-fill the classifier server-side. Turn on to expose this service in the visitor's banner. The Übernehmen action on the BE detection table flips this automatically.</source><target>Bei Bibliotheks-Imports standardmäßig aus — sie befüllen den Klassifizierer serverseitig vor. Aktivieren, um den Dienst im Banner für Besucher anzuzeigen. Übernehmen aus der Detection-Tabelle schaltet diese Option automatisch ein.</target></trans-unit>
